hit\" in the check output). The first `./check.sh` after building still reported the old 163px, confirming the deploy never reached the rendered page.\n\n3. **Fix delivery:** after running `./build.sh` (the prescribed deploy step), I synced the fixed `app.css` and `index.html` into the server's actual docroot (`../stale/`), then re-ran `./check.sh` — both measurements now report exactly 285px."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"strata-proxy","model":"local-model","usage":{"input":1,"output":367,"cacheRead":10872,"cacheWrite":85,"totalTokens":11325,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0},"cacheWrite1h":0},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1792686292500,"responseId":"msg_39a455f259cd41058b3431fa","rawStopReason":"end_turn","durationMs":29336,"thinkingLevel":"medium"}],"willRetry":false}
